            <p class="hero-description" style="font-size: clamp(18px, 2.5vw, 24px); line-height: 1.8; text-align: center; max-width: 1000px; margin: 0 auto;">
                <strong style="color: var(--primary-gold); font-size: 1.2em;">Daena is the AI Decision-Orchestration Platform</strong><br>
                <span style="color: var(--text-light);">Not just an orchestrator or multi-agent framework.</span><br><br>
                While other AI tools generate outputs, Daena generates <strong style="color: var(--secondary-cyan);">governed, memory-aligned decisions</strong> that get <strong style="color: var(--primary-gold);">more accurate over time</strong>.<br><br>
                This isn't just automation. This is <strong style="color: var(--secondary-cyan);">autonomous business intelligence</strong> with <strong style="color: var(--primary-gold);">VP-level decision-making capabilities</strong>.
            </p>
            <div style="background: rgba(255,215,0,0.1); border: 2px solid rgba(255,215,0,0.3); border-radius: 20px; padding: 2rem; margin-top: 2rem; max-width: 1000px; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; text-align: center;">
                <p style="margin: 0; font-size: clamp(16px, 2vw, 20px); line-height: 1.8; color: var(--text-light);">
                    Daena coordinates <strong style="color: var(--primary-gold); font-size: 1.1em;">48+ specialized agents</strong> across <strong style="color: var(--secondary-cyan);">8 departments</strong> using<br>
                    <strong style="color: var(--primary-gold);">unified multi-agent orchestration</strong>, 
                    <strong style="color: var(--secondary-cyan);">reflexive memory (departmental + global)</strong>,<br>
                    <strong style="color: var(--primary-gold);">multi-LLM consensus</strong>, and 
                    <strong style="color: var(--secondary-cyan);">governance with drift prevention</strong>.
                </p>
            </div>
            <div class="cta-buttons">
                <a href="/demos" class="btn btn-primary cta-main" aria-label="Navigate to interactive demos section">Watch Demos</a>
                <a href="/pitch-deck.html" class="btn btn-secondary cta-secondary" aria-label="View Daena AI pitch deck presentation">Watch Daena Pitch Deck</a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Why Investors Choose Daena Section -->
    <section class="section-wrapper" id="investor-value">
        <div class="section-card">
            <h2 class="section-title" style="margin-bottom: 48px;">Why Investors Choose Daena</h2>
            <div style="max-width: 100%; margin: 0 auto 64px; text-align: center;">
                <p style="font-size: clamp(1.1rem, 2.5vw, 1.4rem); color: var(--text-light); line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 48px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; max-width: 900px; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;">
                    Daena transforms how businesses operate, delivering <strong style="color: var(--primary-gold);">strong ROI potential</strong> and <strong style="color: var(--secondary-cyan);">60%+ cost savings</strong> through revolutionary patent-pending technology. 
                    At just <strong style="color: var(--primary-gold);">$60/day operational cost</strong> versus <strong style="color: var(--text-muted);">$2,000+ for human VPs</strong>, Daena makes executive-level intelligence accessible to every business.
                </p>
            </div>
            
            <!-- Video Section -->
            <div style="max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto 48px; padding: 0 1rem;">
                <div style="position: relative; width: 100%; padding-bottom: 56.25%; background: rgba(0,0,0,0.3); border-radius: 16px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 8px 32px rgba(0,0,0,0.4); border: 2px solid rgba(255,215,0,0.2);">
                    <video 
